\newlabel{tab:exp5_storage_results}{{5.5}{26}{Storage tier comparison: model loading breakdown for 8B model (15.4\,GB). NVMe row is directly measured; rows marked $^\dagger $ are analytical estimates ($\text {size}/\text {bandwidth}$).\relax }{table.caption.16}{}}
